  {
   "text": "breaking your GTA 6 character for good? Reports say it's possible."
  },
  {
   "text": "GTA 6 has a Criminal Profile, and it grades how you commit crimes, not how many."
  },
  {
   "text": "The reported states are Professional, Aggressive, Violent, and Psycho."
  },
  {
   "text": "Rockstar's Rob Nelson says the game doesn't force you to play Professional."
  },
  {
   "text": "But go too far, and the profile logo reportedly starts to crack,"
  },
  {
   "text": "then shatters completely."
  },
  {
   "text": "One report says that state stays locked for the rest of your playthrough."
  },
  {
   "text": "Other outlets hedge on the exact triggers, and no formula is published."
  },
  {
   "text": "So tell us below, would you ever risk"
  }
